<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - AT&amp;T raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - AT&amp;T raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers upgraded AT&amp;T Corp to buy from outperform, the office of analyst Blake Bath confirmed.</p>
<p>-- 12-month target price is $55.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 3/8 to 36-3/8 in third market activity but had not yet opened on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
